001DBFr 2               
001DBFr 2  A5 rr              LDA   eval_val_lo
001DC1r 2  48                 PHA
001DC2r 2  A5 rr              LDA   eval_val_hi
001DC4r 2  48                 PHA
001DC5r 2               
001DC5r 2  20 rr rr           JSR   eval_expr
001DC8r 2  90 05              BCC   :+
001DCAr 2  68                 PLA
001DCBr 2  68                 PLA
