001E51r 2               ; do_memberp — MEMBER? value list: return 1 if value in list, else 0
001E51r 2               ;   Arity 0: evaluates its own arguments
001E51r 2               ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
001E51r 2               do_memberp:
