003050r 2  4C rr rr           JMP   eval_continue
003053r 2               
003053r 2               ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
003053r 2               ; do_po — PO "name: print procedure definition
003053r 2               ;   Arity 0 — evaluates its own argument
003053r 2               ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
003053r 2               do_po:
